        "en": "Friend Guard"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Reduce el daño que sufren los aliados.",
        "en": "All friendly Pokémon take 0.75× as much direct damage from moves while this Pokémon is in battle.\n\nThis effect stacks if multiple allied Pokémon have it."
